# observation/ — the network observing itself

Six features, one per habit rung, plus the local-first story (a reading lands with no doorway
reachable) and the outside-observer story (participation is not learnable from the plane). The
directory is named `observation/` and not `observability/` because the harness reserves the
`observability` capability for scenarios that query Grafana, Loki or Prometheus; all but one
scenario here deliberately do not.

Every scenario is born `@wip`: the stations are declared before the code exists, which is the
RED-FIRST discipline the parent CLAUDE.md asks for. Step glue lives in
`steps/observation/*.steps.ts` when it is written; until then the dry run lists the steps as
undefined, which is the honest state.
